# Local state, never published and never committed.
#
# This repository had no ignore file at all until 16 Oct 2026, which is how
# `wrangler pages dev`'s own state directory ended up as an untracked entry in
# every `git status` - a local server's cache and database files, none of which
# belong in a commit. The sibling sites ignore these; this one now does too.
.wrangler/
.pages-dist/
